%% Figure: Community validation voting workflow for a newly submitted report.
%% Render to: Images/Chapter 3/community-validation-workflow.png
flowchart TD
    A["Report enters PendingValidation and appears in the community feed"] --> B["Citizen requests an unused vote ticket and casts an upvote or downvote"]
    B --> C["Relayer verifies the ticket and citizen signature"]
    C --> D{"Ticket and pseudonym unused for this report phase?"}
    D -- No --> E["Reject duplicate vote"]
    D -- Yes --> F["Contract records the vote and updates the tally"]
    F --> G{"Voting window closed?"}
    G -- No --> B
    G -- Yes --> H{"Result by the configured method"}
    H -- Accepted --> I["Report becomes Open"]
    H -- Rejected --> J["Report becomes CommunityRejected"]
